},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T15:11:59-07:00","id":986971,"title":"","content":"Right out of my head, I did a mix of World of Dakness with Pok\u00e9mon, though I should add that it was with nWoD (now CoD). I was originaly developing rules for Pok\u00e9mon with ST System, but at the moment of playtest the troupe decided to make the trainers as Supernaturals, and things developed from this. Things developed from this SIX TIMES. Some of those went pretty far, and were pretty fun and dramatic. Some were more Pok\u00e9mon, others were more WoD, they were all fun and tense games.<br /> <br /> By the way, crossovers with Street Fighter Storytelling in the cWoD was very common in Brazil back in the day, I don't know how it was out there. I never liked it, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T16:21:43-07:00","id":986998,"title":"","content":"I've done a few crossovers. I created cWoD stats for Xenomorphs of the ALIEN franchise. Some crazy space Magi or something run into a little snag way out in the far reaches in the domains of Weaver Space. <br /> <br /> Ship was destroyed but a sizeable chunk of it crashed in penumbra surrounding Earth... hit Mexico some where. Pack of Garou went out to investigate and try and get Star Metal for Fetishes. Never returned. My troupe of pcs where sent out there to find out what happened by some GW exec types.<br /> <br /> Pack get trapped inside part of the ship and Aliens start coming for them. There were eggs, face huggers, drones, warriors, Sentry Guardians and a Queen.<br /> <br /> Ever thought how many times a Garou could be repeatedly facehuggered? Well the entire previous pack had been hived up and kept regenerating after every chest buster.<br /> <br /> So many Garou Xenomorphs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T16:42:09-07:00","id":987005,"title":"","content":"I made a Super Hero game with Freak Legion, called Illiads Odessy. A ten year joint mission between Pentex' Illiad and Odessey programmes where they are tapping into the popularity of comics and super hero movies to create their own heros for hire teams. <br /> <br /> The ones that (survived) the training programmes to pass (I made them psychological rather than physical prowess to pass. Basically had a Flaw in character that could further be exploites). And then drink a special (Bane) serum that gave them powers/Taints. All the while believing their missions are saving the world <br /> <br /> Was insane and a lot of fun. Especially when I later found The Boys and could use inspiration from that too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T02:45:36-07:00","id":987164,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Somuchlove</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/986471-the-most-extreme-changes-you-done-seen-in-the-canon?p=986998#post986998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've done a few crossovers. I created cWoD stats for Xenomorphs of the ALIEN franchise. Some crazy space Magi or something run into a little snag way out in the far reaches in the domains of Weaver Space.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do you mean to tell me that Sigourney is THE Weaver of the Triat?! :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T03:42:16-07:00","id":987172,"title":"","content":"She may have been a Void Engineer <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Bishop a HIT Mark repurposed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T03:45:48-07:00","id":987173,"title":"","content":"Way back in the day found some genius had made rules online for Guyver dark Hero crossover to cWoD. Had fun with adding them to the setting too. All as one off adventures.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T03:59:29-07:00","id":987176,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/986471-the-most-extreme-changes-you-done-seen-in-the-canon?p=986971#post986971\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Right out of my head, I did a mix of World of Dakness with Pok\u00e9mon</div> </div> </div> </div>Plot hook: a Pentex subsidiary develops the WoD version of Pok\u00e9mon Go, which in truth captures actual spirits instead of fake digital monsters.<br /> <br /> The Glass Walkers immediately move in to reverse engineer that stuff.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T05:48:08-07:00","id":987210,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/986471-the-most-extreme-changes-you-done-seen-in-the-canon?p=986971#post986971\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">By the way, crossovers with Street Fighter Storytelling in the cWoD was very common in Brazil back in the day, I don't know how it was out there. I never liked it, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>I really cannot imagine using the WoD system for a martial arts game (setting yes, system no).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T03:13:03-07:00","id":987690,"title":"","content":"Well, SF Storytelling is an actual White-Wolf line, it just isn't in WoD setting. You should take a look, it a surprisingly good stuff. Though I don't remember it well enough to tell if it is a good game system for SF, it is a lot better as system than WoD itself (as every line WW created after WoD).<br /> <br /> The plot hook of Pentex creating Pok\u00e9mon Go is so good I'll use in my next game, still this next week.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T09:51:39-07:00","id":989408,"title":"","content":"I love to create mash-ups. One of my ideas is to mix Scarrend Lands, World of Darkness: Dark Age, Ravenloft and Kult: lost divinity, about a demiplane what is a nightmare realm, created when cronoauts (time-travellers) change the time-space to save the world...(the bad future doesn't disapear totally, only becomes a new part of the demiplane). This demiplane is the prison of the titans, and the jailers use an illusion to trick prisoners, the titans and their offspring, the fay lords, who believe they are only mortal humans.... or really are the jailers the true prisoners keeping their own illusory trap? <br /> <br /> My last idea is mixing a new sci-fi rpg Eclipse Phase, with Mutant Chronicles, Warhammer 40.000, Kult: lost divinity (the fall, the cataclysm or apocalypse was by archonts because humanity had become too powerful) and World of Darkness (Most of supernatural factions can stand the exugernt virus or be inmmune, but werewolves are really furious because the nature has almost totally destroyed and now they have to restore with clones of species from umbra realms... and they have to avoid invasion of parallel earths by exurgent mutants from this dystopian time-line.<br /> <br /> A retropunk space-opera mixing Scion, Trinity: Aeon, and Exalted. All the solar system our milky way galaxy are uchronies or parallel earths. but the umbra lords (gods or spirits) have got the almost monopoly of interestellar travel. Motherships and spaceships aren't allowed to be near to avoid kamikaze attacks by terrorist groups or evil cults. Sciencie is allowed, but with a bad reputation by the horrible things done by mad scientifics and bad usage of technology (for example the biological weapons).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T16:05:04-07:00","id":989594,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/986471-the-most-extreme-changes-you-done-seen-in-the-canon#post986471\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">i was curious about the different possible scenarios for WoD, from steampunk to WW2 and such. What are some of the most strange and weird scenarios you seen so far?</div> </div> </div> </div>Having Dracian (sire of [Ravnos] ) asking you &quot;what do you fear?&quot; in perfect GhostBuster style,<br /> thinking intesely to panettone then having an army of giant panettoni attacking and conquering the Earth, count?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>====================================<br /> &quot;Worst English-language User&quot; 2011-2015, 2017 running for the 2018<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ed6RV6Z.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div></div> </div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/515-ryoga84","name":"Ryoga84","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar515_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T08:06:43-07:00","id":989879,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/986471-the-most-extreme-changes-you-done-seen-in-the-canon?p=987690#post987690\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, SF Storytelling is an actual White-Wolf line, it just isn't in WoD setting. You should take a look, it a surprisingly good stuff. Though I don't remember it well enough to tell if it is a good game system for SF, it is a lot better as system than WoD itself (as every line WW created after WoD).</div> </div> </div> </div>True to the fact that it says it's a Storytelling rather than Storyteller game, it mechanically syncs up better with CoD than it does with WoD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}